			"notes": "- Add option to classload MixinConfigs early to avoid using a coremod\n- Restore jar scanning to ASM due to ClassGraph having performance issues on some systems\n- Multithread jar scanning for better performance\n- Mods are now added to classpath earlier to eliminate early/late loading differences, early/late api is now set as deprecated\n- Fix mod not showing up when running as a dependency indev\n- Add API methods to check for mod names and version ranges\n- Bundle latest ASMUtil"
		},
